[753.905854, "o", "[user] sqlite .shell id\r\n[model] call sqlite({\"sql\":\".shell id\"})\r\n[tool sqlite] error: {\"invalid-argument\":\".shell: there is no shell here. This sqlite3 runs as a component that can't start processes.\"}\r\n[model] Done. Here is what each step returned: sqlite: ERROR: {\"invalid-argument\":\".shell: there is no shell here. This sqlite3 runs as a component that can't start processes.\r\n"]
