[965.774776, "o", "[user] gh pr view 5885\r\n[model] call gh({\"arguments\":\"pr view 5885\"})\r\n[tool gh] ok: #5885 feat(wash): allow configuring the host ID https://github.com/wasmCloud/wasmCloud/pull/5885 State: merged Author: ricochet | created 2026-11-04T23:05:26Z | updated 2026-11-05T13:58:14Z Branches: main <- wasmCloud:codex/wash-host-id (head b156b0be) Mergeable: not computed yet (ask again shortly)...\r\n[model] Done. Here is what each step returned: gh: #5885 feat(wash): allow configuring the host ID https://github.com/wasmCloud/wasmCloud/pull/5885 State: merged Author: r\r\n"]
