[993.675453, "o", "\u001b[0;33m# Each changed file, then each file's patch. curl's transcript cuts each tool result to one line of \r\n# 300 characters; the model reads all of it. The chat page shows the whole result, and draws a diff \r\n# as one: each file's header, added lines in green with their `+`, removed lines in red with their \r\n# `-`.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
